@startuml kairos-view-member-details-sequence
title View Members Directory and Member Detail

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Members List
WebAdmin -> API: GET /members?filters...
API -> DB: SELECT members with filters
DB --> API: Members list
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {members}

Admin -> WebAdmin: Click a member row
WebAdmin -> API: GET /members/{memberId}
API -> DB: SELECT member + attendance + followups + giving summary
DB --> API: Member detail
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {memberDetail}

WebAdmin --> Admin: Show Member Detail page

@enduml
